    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.78,
      568.55,
      286.22,
      657.18
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired: All that divided and defined allotment of land referred in the Sheet No. 01, in the Zene No.04, in the Cadaster Plan No. 421124 situated at the village of Horombawa in the Grama Niladhari Division of Horombawa 1134 in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kuliyapitiya East in the District of Kurunegala in the North Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
