      656.77,
      286.25,
      698.99
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 01 - Name of the land: Bogahalanda; Land Use: There are Home Garden, Permanent 03 Buildings and Temporary Crop Cultivation; Claimant: Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.0584 Hec.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.816690444946289,
