      304.51,
      416.36,
      539.95,
      459.18
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries North: Land lot 26 in F.V.P 210; East: Land lot 26 in F.V.P 210; South: Land lot 26 in F.V.P 210; West: Land lot 26 in F.V.P 210.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      458.58,
      539.83,
      699.83
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land / lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Kuliyapitiya\u2013 East at 10.30 A.M. on 28th day of August 2024, and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st day of August 2024 the nature of their interests in the land , the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land / servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the compensation of such amount. D. P. S. Kumara, Divisional Secretary, Kuliyapitiya - East. At Divisional Secretariat, Kuliyapitiya - East. 24th of June 2024 EOG 06 - 0181",
