    ],
    "text": "UDA/72. I hereby give notice, Section 7 of Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 published in the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2351/33 dated 28.09.2023 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka should be amended PP Maha 7180 as per the following dates and time for the blocks of lands situated at village in Gannoruwa in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Yatinuwara, Kandy District described as follows: Lot No. Date Time 1,2,3,4,5,6,7 28.08.2024 09.30 A. M. All persons interested in the aforesaid lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat of Yatinuwara at the scheduled time on the following date. I hereby requested to notify to me in writing on or before the 21.08.2024 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. S. M. C. Gunarathna, Divisional Secretary, Yatinuwara. At Divisional Secretariat, Yatinuwara. On 20th June 2024 EOG 06 - 0182/2",
